#. 事件は苗木君の個室で起きた…
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The incident took place\n"
"in Makoto's room."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんは
#. <CLT 9>最初に部屋で襲われ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Sayaka was <CLT 9>first attacked\n"
"in the main room<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. その後、シャワールームに
#. 逃げ込んだのよ。
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "She then fled into the bathroom."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人はその後を追って…
msgctxt "0004 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Then the killer ran after her..."
msgstr ""

#. シャワールームに
#. 入ったんだったな。
msgctxt "0005 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "And they got into the bathroom."
msgstr ""

#. そん時、犯人が
#. <CLT 9>ドアノブを壊した<CLT>んだろ…
msgctxt "0006 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"At that point, the killer had to try\n"
"and <CLT 9>bust down the door<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. シャワールームには、
#. <CLT 9>鍵が掛かってた<CLT>からな。
msgctxt "0007 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "...because Sayaka had <CLT 9>locked it<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そこで舞園さんは
#. 犯人に追い詰められて…
msgctxt "0008 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"And finally,\n"
"the culprit had Sayaka cornered..."
msgstr ""

#. しまいにゃ、
#. 包丁で刺されちまったって訳か…
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"And to finish the job, they stabbed\n"
"her with the kitchen knife."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それを…
#. 苗木がやったんでしょ！？
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It was y-you, wasn't it\n"
"Makoto! A-Admit it!"
msgstr ""

#. もう…決まりじゃない…！！
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "We already kn-know the answer!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>確かにそうだな…<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>That's definitely true...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ホントかよ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Seriously!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そんなことって…<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>What you're saying is...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そうですな…<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>For sure!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>言われてみれば…<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Now that you mention it...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>でも、だからって…<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>But even so...<CLT>"
msgstr ""
